<p><strong>Wanted: </strong></p>

<p>Names of the above compounds.</p>

<p>1. [Co(en)<sub>2</sub>(NO<sub>2</sub>)Cl]<sup>+</sup></p>

<p><b>Step 1: </b>Attain the names of the ligands and metal cation. Names can be found here.</p>

